  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Instance owner name with full-width letters does not shown correctly.\n\nFor names starting with full-width letters, nothing is shown at instance owner name.\n\nFor names contains but not starts with full-width letters, Latin letters until few letters before full-width letters, and \"...\" are shown.\n\nFor names without full-width letters (only with Latin letters), owner name is shown correctly.\n\n1st & 2nd image shows first case with user named \"慕狼ゆに\". \"慕狼ゆに\" is totally full-width letters.\n\n3rd & 4th image shows second case with user named \"-四季アキ-Aki_Shiki\". \"-\" is Latin and \"四季アキ\" is full-width letters.\n\n5th & 6th image shows second case with user named \"Matu（まつさん）\". \"Matu\" is Latin and \"（まつさん）\" are full-width letters.\n\n7th & 8th image shows third case with user named \"anatawa12\".\n\n9th & 10th image shows third case with user named \"anatáwa13\".",
